## STEP 6: SPEC UPDATE

If user mentions roadmap, milestones, constraints, or upcoming changes, update `.chess/spec.yaml`:

```yaml
future:
  {topic}:
    upcoming:
      issue: {issue-number}
      change: "{description}"
      eta: "{Nd}" # e.g., "14d" = 14 days
    consumers:
      - file1.ts
      - file2.ts
    constraint: "{must/must-not rule}"
    risk: "{what breaks}"
```

